# Stage 5: Wearable Fusion & Advanced Analytics

This stage elevates SportApp to professional territory by syncing real-world biometric data from smartwatches and providing high-fidelity visual analytics.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Mobile Permissions**: The Flutter app will require 'Body Sensors', 'Activity Recognition', and 'Health Connect' permissions on Android/iOS. Users will see a one-time permission prompt.
> [!NOTE]
> **Chart.js Entegrasyonu**: Web dashboard'daki basit bar/progress çubuklarını interaktif, zoom yapılabilen profesyonel grafiklerle (Chart.js) değiştireceğiz.

